The BMW 1 Series M Sport Shadow Edition was available on the F20/F21 generation (2011-2019), specifically from July 2017 to June 2019. It was based on the M Sport trim and added darkened exterior elements and enhanced equipment. I will evaluate based on a representative model from this period, such as the 118i or 120i M Sport Shadow Edition.

Here is the evaluation based on the F20/F21 BMW 1 Series M Sport Shadow Edition (circa 2017-2019):

*   **price_usd:** Used prices for a 2019 118i M Sport Shadow Edition range from around $25,300 - $28,000 AUD, or around £18,257 ($22,821 USD) average used price. A 2019 125i M Sport Shadow Edition is listed around $26,999 - $21,999 AUD used. These prices are well below the $52,000 market average for a new car. Score: `0.80`.
*   **total_cost_estimate_5yr_usd:** As a used premium car, depreciation is less of a factor, but maintenance and potential repairs on an older car increase costs. Score: `0.40`.
