*   **torque:** Varies by engine. 118i (1.5L) has 220 Nm (162 lb-ft), 120i (2.0L) has 270 Nm (199 lb-ft), 125i (2.0L) has 310 Nm (229 lb-ft). Today's average is 190 lb-ft. The range is from below to above average. Using the 120i as representative: 199 lb-ft is slightly above average. Score: `0.10`.
